            "review_title": "Review at Phở Bát Đá Thuỷ Mộc",
            "review_text": "Cherry P\nWarana78 contributions\n0\nDelicious and Fresh Pho (Big menu)\nJun 2023\nHad the most amazing Pho Bat Da Tai from here today. Highly recommend and was open after 12:00 pm when most food vendors around the area were closing up. The meat was fresh and from the fridge and all ingredients came out on a dish for you to mix into your bowl. The broth came out boiling in a clay bowl and cooked the meat instantly. It was delicious and fresh and we will be back. I am sorry I didn't get a good photo but if you are after Pho this is the place to try!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 22, 2023",
